{"availability":"available","full":"hyeonsangjeon/youtube-dl-nas","name":"youtube-dl-nas","description":"Lightweight authenticated yt-dlp queue for NAS: video, audio, subtitles, mobile sharing, restart-safe downloads, and Docker.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":201,"forks":48,"created":"2018-09-21T10:29:25Z","updated":"2026-10-17T18:08:43Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://hyeonsangjeon.github.io/youtube-dl-nas/","topics":["android","awesome-selfhosted","docker","download-manager","homelab","ios","media-management","mobile-sharing","nas","pwa","python","rest-api","self-hosted","subtitles","synology","video-downloader","youtube","youtube-dl","youtube-downloader","yt-dlp"],"demo":"https://hyeonsangjeon.github.io/youtube-dl-nas/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T18:51:16.883Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T18:51:16.883Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T18:51:16.883Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:51:57.616Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"curated-list","name":"Awesome Selfhosted","url":"https://github.com/awesome-selfhosted/awesome-selfhosted"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T15:02:23.673Z","stars":200,"forks":49},{"at":"2026-10-11T14:51:57.616Z","stars":200,"forks":49},{"at":"2026-10-17T18:51:16.883Z","stars":201,"forks":48}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["youtube-dl-nas is a small NAS-friendly download queue for videos, audio, and subtitles. It wraps yt-dlp with an authenticated web dashboard, real-time progress updates, download history, file actions, and a REST API for automation.","This release: AI clients can browse the entire NAS library with stable pagination and newest/oldest download sorting. MCP token activity writes are coalesced, abandoned previews are cleaned up, and AI Connect distinguishes server readiness from actual client authentication. Existing volumes and mobile sharing remain unchanged. Changelog"],"features":["Queue video, audio, or subtitle downloads from a browser.","Connect an AI client to research, preview, and approve topic collections on the same NAS address, with paginated library lookup and no embedded LLM service.","Choose an explicit Compatible MP4 profile when a client requires H.264 video and AAC audio; existing Best and resolution profiles keep their current behavior.","Keep the last successfully queued dashboard profile ready on each device without auto-submitting the next URL.","Use the login, terms, and dashboard flows in English, Korean, Simplified Chinese, or Polish, with browser-language detection and a saved language preference."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hyeonsangjeon/youtube-dl-nas/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"03113f09e0b882784b0321b6c0326b09c6fd8fa632790f0d8bf506adc533db68","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T15:02:23.673Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:51:57.755Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"youtube-dl-nas is a small NAS-friendly download queue for videos, audio, and subtitles. It wraps yt-dlp with an authenticated web dashboard, real-time progress updates, download history, file actions, and a REST API for automation.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hyeonsangjeon/youtube-dl-nas/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Use the login, terms, and dashboard flows in English, Korean, Simplified Chinese, or Polish, with browser-language detection and a saved language preference.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hyeonsangjeon/youtube-dl-nas/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The language selector is available before sign-in and from the authenticated dashboard.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hyeonsangjeon/youtube-dl-nas/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"03113f09e0b882784b0321b6c0326b09c6fd8fa632790f0d8bf506adc533db68","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hyeonsangjeon/youtube-dl-nas/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T14:51:57.